@startuml
title Receitando - UML de classes: contratos do frontend
' Receitando - UML textual versionado; banco real: Neon PostgreSQL via Hyperdrive.
skinparam backgroundColor #FBF2E8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #96462B
skinparam Shadowing false

hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class Recipe {
  +id: string
  +title: string
  +slug: string
  +description: string
  +prepMinutes: number
  +servings: number
  +ingredients: RecipeIngredient[]
  +tags: string[]
}
class Ingredient {
  +id: string
  +name: string
  +normalizedName: string
  +category: string
  +isStaple?: boolean
}
class RecipeIngredient {
  +ingredientId: string
  +name: string
  +quantity: number | null
  +unit: string | null
  +optional: boolean
}
class RecipeCatalogResponse {
  +items: RecipeCatalogItem[]
  +pagination: object
  +filters: object
}
class RecipeCatalogItem {
  +id: string
  +slug: string
  +title: string
  +imageUrl: string | null
}
class MatchRecipeResult {
  +id: string
  +compatibility: number
  +status: RecipeMatchStatus
  +foundIngredients: MatchIngredient[]
  +missingIngredients: MatchIngredient[]
}
class RecipeAdaptationResult {
  +engineVersion: "1.0"
  +scaleFactor: number
  +confidence: number
  +ingredients: RecipeAdaptationIngredient[]
}
class RecipeAdaptationIngredient {
  +ingredientId: string
  +originalName: string
  +adaptedName: string
  +optional: boolean
  +unavailable: boolean
}
Recipe "1" *-- "0..*" RecipeIngredient
RecipeIngredient --> Ingredient : ingredientId
RecipeCatalogResponse "1" *-- "0..*" RecipeCatalogItem
RecipeAdaptationResult "1" *-- "0..*" RecipeAdaptationIngredient
note bottom of RecipeAdaptationResult
  Contratos extraídos de frontend/src/types/recipe.ts.
  Este diagrama representa tipos de interface, não tabelas PostgreSQL.
end note
@enduml
